        <div class='media-image pull-left'>
            <a href="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/publications/mpr/mpr-2026-07-15/"><img width="90" height="90" src="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/MPR-thumbnail_July-90x90.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="" loading="lazy" /></a>
